     definitely knows, DOORS renders its screen normally, and the colours are
     repainted on top a frame later. Guaranteed to work, because the only
     assumption is that those objects exist, and the probe shows they do.

     Repainted repeatedly for a second because the screen animates in and
     DOORS writes those properties as it does. ]]

